---
title: "reserve::repay_amount (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_overpay: debt.lt(repay_amount)?
    q_check_overpay --> q_overpay: repay > debt
    q_check_overpay --> q_normal: repay <= debt
    q_overpay --> q_deposit_over: cash_reserve += (repay - debt.ceil()), debt = 0
    q_normal --> q_deposit_normal: debt = debt - repay_amount
    q_deposit_over --> [*]: deposit_underlying(coin)
    q_deposit_normal --> [*]: deposit_underlying(coin)

    note right of q_check_overpay
        INV-001: overpayment excess treated as donation to cash_reserve
        INV-002: debt can be reduced to zero
        INV-003: cash increases by coin.value()
    end note
